  "description": {
   "en": "Shao Mei is the lowest ranking court lady in the imperial harem. Though her job is to pull weeds, she possesses one special talent - the skilled touch of arranging the flowers that adorn woman's head, their symbol of dignity and their life.\n\nDespite her dreams of becoming an official florist, her low-ranking status bars her from taking the exam. One day, however, the emperor's wife comes to seek Shao Mei's aid. \n\nShao Mei's arranging technique and floral abilities become the keys to saving the case swirling around the palace."
  },
